{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45462","headline":"题化城寺 · 应物","name":"题化城寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平高选处创莲宫，一水萦流处处通。\n画阁昼开迟日畔，禅房夜掩碧云中。\n平川不见龙行雨，幽谷遥闻虎啸风。\n偶与游人论法要，真元浩浩理无穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45462.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45462","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}